		{
			description: [
				"&a&l▌ Private goods module guide"
				"&7This integration pack adds a large number of expansion modules. This chapter will guide you through understanding and applying these new additions."
				""
				"&e&l▌ Browse suggestions"
				"&7It is highly recommended that when reaching each new technological stage, you return here to see the new machines and functional blocks available at that stage."
				""
				"&e&l▌ Note"
				"&7The machines are in no particular order, they are just sorted for convenience."
			]
