		{
			dependencies: ["4F61FBBCF28E1327"]
			description: [
				"&9&lGTL-Extend&fUniversal steam engine"
				""
				"&7▌ Function:"
				"&lThe machine comes with a default parallelism of 16384"
				"&lAll formula processing time is 10 ticks"
				"&lignores the voltage level of any recipe"
				"&lcan install maintenance compartment"
				""
				"&7▌ Suggestions:"
				"&l&6After selecting the mode after this machine is formed, it is recommended to remove any block and let it re-form, otherwise it will prompt that the power input is insufficient or the formula cannot be found."
				""
				"&l&6In the GTL integration package, most machines that run on steam in the steam stage have inexplicable shutdown bugs. It is recommended to give up using this type of machine in the IV stage."
			]
			id: "590A215AF01C991A"
			size: 1.5d
