			description: [
				"&9&lGTL-Extend \"Steam Integrated Ore Processing Center\""
				"&7is an excellent transitional choice in the early stage and can be used stably until the big OP stage."
				""
				"&7▌ Function:"
				"&lis a small OP with extremely high cost performance in the early stage and a processing speed comparable to full speed."
				""
				"&7▌ Suggestions:"
				"&l&6The input port must be placed close to the side of the main block"
				"&l&6The steam input port must be located on the left side of the main block where there is no main block."
				"&l&6The output port must be located on the left side of the overall structure of the machine"
