		{
			dependencies: ["145D5881FE33488E"]
			description: [
				"&9&lGTL-Extend「Quantum Computer」"
				""
				"&7▌ Function:"
				"The basic computing power range of&lis&e1024 ~ 2,147,483,647 CWU/t"
				"&lcoil temperature (1K~96000K) and circuit configuration (No. 1-8) each affect&650% &7’s final computing power"
				"The final computing power of&lis determined by the formula: 1024 + (MAX_INT-1024) × [0.5×(temperature/96000) + 0.5×(circuit/8)]"
				""
				"&7▌ Suggestions:"
				"&l&6Energy consumption increases exponentially with computing power, reaching the level of&c10^20EU/t&6. Please be sure to plan the power well."
				"&l&6Every time&e1M CWU/t&6computing power is generated,&b1L/t extreme cold ice&6is consumed for cooling. If insufficient, the machine will be shut down."
				"&l&6needs to be bound to the player&6wireless network&6is powered and automatically consumes coolant from the fluid container in the structure"
				"After&l&6is formed, it must be bound with a flash memory to a&6wireless computing target warehouse&6(needs to be used with a switch) before it can be started."
				"&l&6It is not recommended to use advanced coils and high circuit configurations in the UHV stage, and the power may not be able to support it."
			]
