			description: [
				"&6&l\"GT Copy Tool\""
				"&9is a region copy tool specially designed for GT and its accessories, which can copy warehouse configurations and complex structures."
				""
				"&7▌ Function:"
				"&lcan copy all warehouses, structures and their complete configuration in the area"
				"&lAfter turning on the container binding mode, you can generate templates with one click based on the copied area."
				"&lAfter enabling extended replication in the configuration, additional components such as AE cables and synthetic terminals can be copied (no consumption)"
				"&lcan directly save/read structures by operating memory in creative mode"
				""
				"&7▌ Suggestions:"
				"The default power limit in the&l&6configuration is&e100M EU &6. Please adjust it according to your needs."
				"&l&6Due to technical reasons, it is currently impossible to copy the creation energy unit."
