			description: [
				"&6&l\"Network configuration flash memory\""
				"&9is a network binding and configuration storage tool dedicated to adaptive power grid systems."
				""
				"&7▌ Tutorial:"
				"&l1. When holding &5, left-click&fand click&6adaptive distribution grid system terminal&fto store the&eowner data&7and&efrequencies of the terminal."
				""
				"&l2. Put any level of&dgrid energy warehouse/laser target warehouse&finto the adaptive setting of the&6adaptive power distribution system terminal &f. The number must be 64."
				""
				"&l3. The second hand holds the network configuration flash memory with saved data, and the main hand holds the&dadaptive grid energy warehouse/laser target warehouse&fand places it in the multi-block structure like a normal energy warehouse. It can be boosted by dual warehouses."
				""
				"&l4. After the subsequent voltage level is increased, make the&dgrid energy warehouse/laser target warehouse&fof the corresponding level and put it into the adaptive interface of the&6adaptive power distribution system terminal &f."
				""
				"&7▌ Suggestions:"
				"&l&6This is an essential tool for configuring and managing adaptive power grid networks"
