		{
			dependencies: ["0CB9366F857D7D68"]
			description: [
				"&9&lGTLAdditions「Material spectrum analysis warehouse」"
				""
				"&7▌ Function:"
				"&lcan be installed in three types of ore processing plants: integrated/advanced/space-based, with a maximum of one per structure"
				"&lGUI has three frequency bands. Each band has a hidden target value and three lights. The number of lights = activation level."
				"&lLevel 1 error is ±80, Level 2 error is ±35, Level 3 error is ±5 (you can enter numbers or drag the slider)"
				""
				"&lfrequency band 1 (for integration factory): parallel magnification 4/6/8/10 (level 0→3)"
				"&lBand 1 (for advanced factories): additional threads +72/+96/+128/+144"
				"&lFrequency Band 1 (for space-based factories): no profit (infinite parallelization)"
				""
				"&lBand 2: Voltage probability bonus × (level + 1). Example: At level 2, 5% bonus → 15%"
				""
				"&lBand 3: Recipe consumption multiplier (integrated factory) or fluid consumption multiplier (advanced factory): 0.8/0.65/0.5/0.4"
				"&lBand 3 (for space-based factories): no profit"
				""
				"&lperfect frequency modulation (zero error in three frequency bands):"
				"&l• Integration factory: lossy overclocking→lossless overclocking"
				"&l• Advanced factory: cross-recipe thread × 2"
				"&l• Tianji Factory: Double the recipe output"
				""
				"&7▌ Suggestions:"
				"&l&6The space-based factory cannot obtain income from frequency band 1 and frequency band 3, only perfect frequency modulation is effective"
				"&l&6The bonus of frequency band 2 only acts on the \"voltage probability bonus\", not the basic probability"
			]
			id: "17BF01D34200596A"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2B4E32D45F1C9344"
				item: "gtladditions:spectral_analysis_hatch"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 1.5d
			y: 13.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["145D5881FE33488E"]
			description: [
				"&9&lGTLAdditions「Subatomic Replacement Core」"
				""
				"&7▌ Function:"
				"The transmutation bus needs to be installed in the&lstructure"
				"&lcan only use titan steel or above grade coils"
				"&lrequires an energy input bin that can provideUHVvoltage. Each working tick consumes a fixed amount ofUHVpower."
				"&lA conversion card or ordinary star array needs to be placed in the card slot of the host GUI (compressed star array cannot be placed)"
				""
				"&lThe machine will continue to run after it is formed, and block conversion will be performed at the end of each round."
				""
				"&lconversion card performance (the higher the value, the stronger the parallel capability):"
				"&l• Conversion card: 60 ticks per round, parallel = coil temperature/100 squared"
				"&l• High-speed conversion card: 40 ticks per round, parallel = coil temperature/100 to the 3.5 power"
				"&l• Extreme conversion card: 30 ticks per round, parallel = coil temperature/100 raised to the power 4.2"
				"&l• Star array: 20 ticks per round, parallel = coil temperature/100 raised to the power of 6.35"
				""
				"&7▌ Supplement:"
				"&l&6The star array is the shortest in each round, but the ordinary star array needs to be placed, and the compressed star array cannot be used."
				"&l&6Each card can be converted into different types in each round: the conversion card/high-speed card can only convert one type in each round, and the extreme card/star array can continuously convert multiple matching inputs in the same round."
			]
			id: "6919346F0559C253"
			tasks: [{
				id: "46A252DF00E2A665"
				item: "gtladditions:subatomic_transmutatioon_core"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 7.5d
			y: 18.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["480AF64C4FF681FC"]
			description: [
				"&9&lGTLAdditions「Vientiane Transcription Node」"
				""
				"&7▌ Function:"
				"&lIt is a redstone output component, and the redstone signal is output from the front of the node."
				"&lcan be installed in the following two machines:"
				""
				"&l• Catalytic selection array: At the beginning of each catalytic cycle, a redstone signal of 1-15 is output to indicate the catalyst grouping required for this round."
				""
				"&l• Chrono boost engine: After the structure is formed, open the node GUI to configure the minimum temperature, maximum temperature and inverted redstone mode. The node will calculate the redstone output based on the current engine temperature and the set interval."
				"&l- Normal mode: A redstone signal is emitted when the temperature is within the set range, and no signal is emitted when it is below the minimum value."
				"&l- Inverted mode: emit a redstone signal when the temperature is outside the set range (including below the minimum value)."
				"&l- Configurable temperature range: 48000K to 105000K."
				""
				"&7▌ Suggestions:"
				"&l&6The temperature configuration is only valid for the hypertime boost engine. There is no need to configure the temperature in the catalytic selection array."
			]
			id: "08B75C2ED476B1F1"
			tasks: [{
				id: "21D830245D45C5EB"
				item: "gtladditions:vientiane_transcription_node"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 19.5d
			y: 22.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["18D5CE23D835D993"]
			description: [
				"&9&lGTLAdditions「Transmutation Bus」"
				""
				"&7▌ Function:"
				"&lIt is the dedicated input/output bus of the Subatomic Displacement core, used for block transformations."
				"An AE item storage disk must be placed inside &l, and the converted output will be written to this disk first."
				"&lIf it can be connected to the AE network, the transmutation bus will automatically return the output from the disk to the network."
				"&lYou can configure the input blocks and quantities to be requested in the GUI, and it will pull the corresponding items from the AE network just like the ME input bus."
				"&linternal storage slot supports AE item storage disk and endless item storage disk."
				""
				"&7▌ Note:"
				"&l&6Sharing of this bus is not allowed in multi-block structures."
				"&l&6The capacity of the bus is completely determined by the item disks placed inside."
			]
			id: "02A3B54CAFA9C9B0"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1C09F8C6D71419B9"
				item: "gtladditions:me_block_conservation"
